Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.17,top,MIMI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:08.86,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,I was invited to have tea with the queen, \Nwhere we were shot at with arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.20,main,QUEEN,0,0,0,,You are so super cool, Mimi! I adore you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:17.12,italics,MIMI/NA,0,0,0,,It would seem that the queen \Ndidn't hate me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:15.45,sign_Verdana,SIGN FX,0,0,0,,{\c&H404DEE&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\bord3\an8\move(315,160,315,160)\fad(1,146)}SLAP
