Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.81,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,People say I speak my mind, but \Nmaybe it's because I like singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:33.56,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,I like bright songs that cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:36.06,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Songs about fishermen catching \Nhuge tuna are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:37.39,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,The other day, I actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:39.67,main,MIMI,0,0,0,,Oh, I spoke my mind again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:40.06,sign_Georgia,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,65)\c&H141722&\bord4\shad0\fs19\3c&HF4F3FC&}Next Time
